# Generated, and not worth keeping. Everything here is rebuilt by ./harness/run-all.sh or
# `npm run build`. NEVER COMMIT A BUILD OUTPUT: it produces a diff for every developer who
# runs the build, and a bundle carrying a timestamp produces one on every single run.
node_modules
package-lock.json

# the browser bundle and the stylesheet esbuild emits alongside it
levant/main.js
levant/main.js.map
levant/main.css
levant/main.css.map

# the engine as the suites import it, and the canon world as the suites author fixtures from
harness/new.cjs
harness/scenario.cjs

# scratch copies
*.bak*

# Claude Code's own directory: local settings, and the worktrees EnterWorktree creates under
# .claude/worktrees/. A worktree is a second checkout of this repo, so committing it would
# nest the repo inside itself.
.claude/
